<description>&lt;p&gt;PKK militants have withdrawn from four camps in northern Iraq as part of a peace process with Turkey, while Iranian drones struck a Kurdish opposition camp in the same region. Iraqi fighter jets have destroyed a Daesh position in an eastern province. US envoy Tom Barrack met Iraqi judge Faiq Zaidan in Baghdad to discuss economic partnership and security cooperation. Four drug traffickers were sentenced in Dhi Qar and a meeting praised Al-Zaidi after a productive discussion in Baghdad. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE4tZUs1ZXNiTjRic24tY3ZuNXJ0dDBrMnoyWnJELXlCcmg4LV9FU1hhU0xYMUZxbkxGaUJ5TGtsNW5XQTZNdUV4TDd4dGI3WkEzYkVhVFBsbk1jckVjd2Zpb2VjTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNTzg3OWhheV8xYVloc1NwQkdXNkRWNWpRVExVSG1mYUZ6eU5ab0Nxa2hCYjhVbE0zUS1IQnppeGJBTVNkNkNlTUtkVjZ6NWk1d2s3SkZJMGk0NDVCcEl3NHFvRzFsNHhjU0ZJd21sREdPMW9fTW4wQm52YWxpSXNraDNLMmVFcXFtM1NSX0Q5LUJTWEFKMHF4ZFBZbjJrTjh2VkV3c0FJZjk?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQNXY0TmlXRUc5TnQ0STlfSjltVXEyWlBkTnBNMDlHV21iVFFkaGdTMEc4QUVaVHdiajVqbXN1ajZfMGpGdUN5NVY4aGlUdlFLVjhTU0xhSkNhS1dTcWpvbjJIaDQwUUtTQkZPanR6QnNIb1pkaGc0Nzh0MzNvbnlRNTE5cXhQa2s5MlVNWE5uNUFxZlBfZFB6MUItdlU3RnFGSy03Z2ZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Iraqi News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE42ZlZQTXVtUndkWHFwOGNTV1ZRMmljR085bzJtTmZ4cEQ4VXVoN0gzaXVHd1A5MEY4SWF3WmZJcDVTVXJacElCN3VhczBJVnhNalJIdWdkWmpGSHVIX2NMaGdrQmY5dG1udUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQMkR5ZEdJU2JfYmE4VkJ2bW